           <string>Generate Clausius-Mossotti curves with the dielectric particle models, load experimental DEP spectra from OpenDEP Control, OpenDEP Compute or Excel, and make publication-ready graphs. A project keeps copies of its scatters and curves together with the graph settings; your original files are never modified.</string>
